WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
The COVID-19 pandemic

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:04.240
will have a huge effect
on Thanksgiving this year.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.550
A lot of families will not
travel and gather together,

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.600
but what about the ones that will?

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.970
Amazon's created a brand
new echo device with Alexa

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.210
built just for this
year's family gatherings.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:17.043
Take a look.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.420
I'm gonna need a Xanax to prepare me

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.120
for what your mother's gonna
say at the dinner table.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.460
Don't worry, Alexa's on it.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.293
Huh?

00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:29.220
Mm, stuffing's great babe.

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.210
Thanks.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.410
You know what's not great?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.790
This damn China virus,

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.640
and the lockdown's worse than the disease.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:38.240
[Alexa] Hey, who's in the mood
for some celebrity trivia?

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.073
Yes please.

00:00:39.073 --> 00:00:40.320
I am!
I am!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:41.153
I am!

00:00:41.153 --> 00:00:41.986
[Narrator] Just in time

00:00:41.986 --> 00:00:44.610
for what's sure to be a
stressful family Thanksgiving,

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.910
it's the new Amazon Echo,
with subject-changing Alexa.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.220
[Alexa] Did you know that Ryan Gosling

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.340
and Sandra Bullock once dated?

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.750
I did not know that,

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:54.750
I'm just looking forward

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.310
to Trump's second
inauguration on January 20th.

00:00:57.310 --> 00:00:58.250
Okay.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.210
[Alexa] Speaking of presidents,

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.340
did you know that President
Theodore Roosevelt

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.577
had a pet hyena?

00:01:02.577 --> 00:01:03.410
Oh.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.350
Hey kids, who would like a pet hyena?

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:06.694
Me, I do!

00:01:06.694 --> 00:01:07.527
Me, me!

00:01:07.527 --> 00:01:08.560
Thanks Alexa.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:09.670
[Mom] Mom does too.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:12.850
[Narrator] Amazon Echo,
with subject-changing Alexa,

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:15.383
your most important
guest this Thanksgiving.

